<section class="z z--about" id="about">
  <div class="kj-icon kj-icon--5" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/kurage-icon.png" alt=""></div>
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="sec-head__label">About</span>
    <h2 class="sec-head__title">KURAGEについて</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-intro">
      <h2 class="about-stmt">AIの時代だからこそ、<br><em>人間の手で書かれた文章</em>に<br>こだわるウェブマガジン。</h2>
      <p class="about-desc">KURAGEは、人間のいびつな感情を楽しむためだけの場所をつくるウェブマガジンです。</p>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="about-stat"><span class="about-stat__v" data-count="15">0</span><span class="about-stat__u">+</span><span class="about-stat__l">連載作品</span></div>
        <div class="about-stat"><span class="about-stat__v" data-count="100">0</span><span class="about-stat__u">+</span><span class="about-stat__l">クリエイター</span></div>
        <div class="about-stat"><span class="about-stat__v">1万</span><span class="about-stat__u">字</span><span class="about-stat__l">平均ボリューム</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-facts">
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">レーベル</span><span class="about-fact__v">KURAGE（海月舎）</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">運営</span><span class="about-fact__v">アドネス株式会社 出版部</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">設立</span><span class="about-fact__v">2026年</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">代表</span><span class="about-fact__v">山内 悠人</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">事業</span><span class="about-fact__v">ウェブマガジン「KURAGE」運営<br>書籍の企画・編集・出版</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">理念</span><span class="about-fact__v">何もかも投げ出して、ただひたすらに文章を読みたいと思った。</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
